<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-041" chapter-id="c-liangshu-041-liang41" source-id="s-liangshu-041-liang41-ws1512987">
  <p id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA">王規</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA">威明</persName>，琅邪臨沂人。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p001:m0013" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>，齊太尉南昌文憲公。父<persName id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p001:m0025" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAA">騫</persName>，金紫光祿大夫南昌安侯。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p002:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA">規</persName>辭疾不拜，於鐘山宗熙寺築室居焉。大同二年，卒，時年四十五。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p003:m0001" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA">褒</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-041-liang41:p003:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA">子漢</persName>，七歲能屬文。</p>
</text>
